ess and operations teams to drive adoption and platform growth.","Bridged technical and business requirements by translating on-ground agricultural needs into efficient, scalable solutions."]},{title:"Software Engineer → Senior Software Engineer",company:"BIZOM (Mobisy Technologies Pvt Ltd.)",period:"September 2021 - April 2024",tech:"ReactJS, Next, JavaScript, HTML & CSS",badge:"Promoted",highlights:["Started and led Phase One development of the Claims project — a React application built from scratch under the UI Architecture guidelines, ensuring best practices for long-term scalability, optimal performance, and maintainability from day one.","Streamlined development workflows by collaborating with design and product teams, reducing feature delivery time by 30%. Designed optimal UI flows with UI architects, improving user navigation and consistency, leading to a 20% increase in user engagement.","Implemented a multi-step screen flow, enhancing form navigation and ensuring seamless add/edit functionality, reducing user errors by 25%.","Developed reusable modal components with robust error handling, decreasing UI-related bugs by 40%.","Built a configurable multilevel select component, optimizing data selection and improving operational efficiency by 35%. Integrated Drag-and-Drop functionality for hierarchy management, enhancing reusability and reducing task completion time by 50%.","Warehouse Onboarding Platform Revamp: Revamped and unified multiple warehouse onboarding modules into a configuration-driven React application with dynamic forms, reusable components, and optimized data caching, improving maintainability, user experience, and onboarding efficiency.","Capping (Pricing & Discount Rules Management): Developed a React-based pricing and discount management module with configurable business rules, approval workflows, and real-time status tracking, enabling efficient management of quantity-based pricing policies.","Enhanced global UX by implementing UI Aliasing and integrating legacy router-APIs for seamless user transitions.","Enhanced development efficiency by 40% by contributing to the WebMDS component library, developing reusable and accessible UI components, including Tabs, Radio Buttons, and International Mobile-Number Input.","Debugged and enhanced a Dynamic Form Renderer using Formik and Yup, ensuring flexible, schema-driven form handling with robust validation.","Developed a common API utility to standardize request handling across multiple endpoints and protocols, improving maintainability.","Strengthened code quality and reliability by writing comprehensive test cases for utility functions and implementing Storybook for reusable component documentation.","Strengthened code quality and reliability by writing unit test cases using Jest, ensuring robust frontend functionality across multiple modules."]},{title:"Frontend Developer (React JS)",company:"Varadhi Smartek",period:"Apr 2021 - June 2021",tech:"ReactJS, JavaScript, HTML & CSS",highlights:["Developed reusable React-based product card components for a food E-commerce application using clean, scalable UI architecture.","Built product listing pages with filtering, sorting, and search to enhance user experience and product discovery.","Designed responsive landing pages and dashboard UIs with a focus on performance and usability.","Integrated Google Maps API for location-based features supporting fast delivery flows.","Explored React Native and delivered a basic mobile app login screen."]},{title:"Frontend Intern (ReactJS)",company:"Aztlan",period:"November 2020 - March 2021",tech:"ReactJS, Redux, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS",highlights:["Developed core features for a Meeting Management App, built a responsive React UI from Figma designs using Rebass.","Implemented Redux, Tailwind CSS, and TypeScript, and explored WebRTC to support collaboration, UX, and data-driven insights."]}];function pj(){return x.jsx("section",{className:"py-24 px-6 bg-slate-50/70 border-y bor